@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam actorBorderColor #17324D
skinparam actorFontColor #17324D
skinparam usecase {
 BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
}
skinparam rectangle {
 BorderColor #94A3B8
 FontColor #17324D
}
title Resumefolio | Git transfer and collaboration use cases
actor "Authorized repository participant" as user
actor "Supported Git client" as client
rectangle "Resumefolio | System boundary" {
 usecase "Clone a repository\nUC-D09-CLONE" as clone [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d09-clone]]
 usecase "Push a change\nUC-D09-PUSH" as push [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d09-push]]
 usecase "Fetch / Pull repository content\nParent UC-D09; GIT-D03" as fetch [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d09]]
 usecase "Open a pull request\nUC-D09-REQUEST" as request [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d09-request]]
 usecase "Review a pull request\nUC-D09-REVIEW" as review [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d09-review]]
 usecase "Merge an eligible pull request\nUC-D09-MERGE" as merge [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d09-merge]]
}
user -- clone
user -- push
user -- fetch
user -- request
user -- review
user -- merge
client -- clone
client -- push
client -- fetch
legend bottom
Sources: GIT-D02/D03/D05-D07 and UC-D09.
Participant and Git client identify human and technical external contexts.
Fetch/Pull remain an explicit parent capability, not a newly allocated child ID.
Review and merge use current revision context; merge is not deployment approval.
Associations show proposed external interactions, not permission grants.
No include/extend dependency or actor inheritance is asserted.
endlegend
@enduml
